Source landscape: the 2023 documentary universe for AMLO in Mexico is dominated by militarized public-security records, Ayotzinapa/Ayotzinapa-related oversight, National Guard legality, and civilian-harm/accountability documents. I did not find an interstate-war record set; the strongest 2B leads are domestic militarization, military transparency, and alleged abuse/accountability sources. I kept official, NGO, academic, court, and reputable news leads, including sources that are favorable, adverse, mixed, and exculpatory.

